{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51717","headline":"过旧居 · 陈裕","name":"过旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日颜回宅，今爲裹饭家。\n不闻吟秀句，只见𫗕（一作餔）油麻\n豉汁锅中沸，粕餻案上葩（一作爬）。\n朝朝唯早起，檐从自排衙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}